{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19628","headline":"古松感兴 · 皇甫松","name":"古松感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇天后土力，使我向此生。\n贵贱不我均，若爲天地情。\n我家世道德，旨意匡文明。\n家集四百卷，独立天地经。\n寄言青松姿，岂羡朱槿荣。\n昭昭大化光，共此遗芳馨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫松","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}